Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.47,Default,kid,0,0,0,,Over here, over here! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.10,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,A stepsister is essentially
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:44.65,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.60,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\blur4\3c&H444242&\pos(320,150)\c&HFAF6EE&}Thursday, July 16th
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.36,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,We simply became siblings one day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:53.94,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,because our parents suddenly \Ndecided to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:57.51,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,We don't have the sense of kinship \Nthat a genetic connection provides,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.78,0:01:02.02,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,nor do we have any shared \Nexperience living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:05.56,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's not complicated. \NWe're obviously strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:08.70,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:14.86,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Now that it's been a month since \NDad and Akiko-san got married
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:18.14,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,and the four of us, including \Nher daughter, began living together,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:22.05,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm starting to realize that my \Nstepsister, this "stranger,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.05,0:01:26.06,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,actually occupies a much \Nmore ambiguous position.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:29.52,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,She's a stranger I share a home with now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:33.77,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think it's probably fair to call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:39.08,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,But then, when I ask myself \Nwhat our relationship is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.48,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm back, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.91,0:02:07.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Tutor me in modern lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:10.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fax1\c&H505150&\pos(127.466,58.267)\frz13.44}Modern Lit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:10.30,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.45,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs18\shad0\bord0\fay-.11\c&HB9B4A9&\pos(402.667,158)}Asamura\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hAyase
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:46.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What was your score?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:48.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I got a 38.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:50.96,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Wow, that's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:55.22,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I had a feeling that's how it would go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:57.42,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,610)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8FCEAB&\b1\pos(320,155)}Episode 4 {\fs14}"Tendenc{\c&H80B7E9&}ies {\c&H8FCEAB&}and Strategies"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:04:00.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I've never been very good at lit, \Nso I expected to fail this time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:03.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Even though you get high \Nscores in other subjects?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:08.04,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I can never really understand how \Nthe characters feel and all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:11.35,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's not what I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:14.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You seem the especially considerate type.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:16.49,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Does it look that way to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:22.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. At least with me, \Nyou try to understand my position,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,and then compromise so we can get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:27.53,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You've got it backwards, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:28.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:34.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We have to compromise exactly because \Nwe can't understand others' feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You might have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:43.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But honestly, my grade this time\N could be a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.73,0:04:45.89,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If I don't pass the retest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:48.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll be forced to take make-up\N lessons during summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:51.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I can see why you'd want to avoid that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:56.24,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And I wanted to work over summer vacation...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:05:00.98,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry. Not finding you a \Nwell-paying job is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:05.04,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, no... I'm not blaming you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.01,0:05:09.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,In fact, I feel bad for taking advantage of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:26.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,If it's okay with you, \NI'd be happy to help you study modern lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:35.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:47.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You do all right with the\N essay questions at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:53.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But your answers for the book questions\N at the end are full of blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:58.69,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Do you struggle with the novels so \Nmuch that you just ran out of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:01.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You sound like you were \Nwatching over my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:02.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:04.85,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No. Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:08.40,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But it kind of stings that you \Npinpointed my weakness so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:10.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Not exactly a great feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:14.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry. I should have put it more gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:15.65,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:20.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Also, I know you're just being blunt \Nbecause you're seriously trying to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I shouldn't get pissed over it. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:27.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's okay. I guess that makes us even.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:33.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So it looks like you struggled the \Nmost with the part about {\i1}Sanshiro{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:34.12,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:40.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Natsume Soseki's {\i1}Sanshiro{\i0} is all about \Nthe challenge of falling in love freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.57,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think people today understand \Nsome parts of the story better
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,than people did when the book was written.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:48.76,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Really? Which parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:55.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Actually, this might go faster if you tell me\Nwhich aspects of it were hardest for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:07:01.09,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um... I don't understand what Sanshiro \Nis thinking, or what Mineko is thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:04.82,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,or their motives for any of \Nthe choices they both make.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:11.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um... You get that Sanshiro \Nhas fallen for Mineko, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:12.71,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,He has?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:20.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Fallen for, as in... he likes her \Nin a romantic way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:25.77,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. Remember, he gets jealous \Nwhen other men approach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.42,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Isn't it kind of obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:29.52,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,He's jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:35.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You mean he doesn't like it \Nwhen Mineko talks to other men?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:41.75,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But he doesn't tell her to stop, does he? \NIf he hates it so much, he should say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:46.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it's too psychologically \Nchallenging for him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:49.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,to be so direct with the person he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:58.22,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't get people who hide their \Ntrue feelings and don't say what they mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:06.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay, can you imagine a situation where \Nyou couldn't express your true feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Maybe like the first time you fell in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:12.59,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,The first time I fell in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:19.38,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Have you ever been so head over heels that \Nyou couldn't make the right decisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.72,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No. I have zero experience with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:26.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you, Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:29.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:32.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Hmm, so you don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:34.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:39.17,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Not really. But if neither \Nof us has ever been in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:43.46,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,then it's probably safe to assume our lit \Ngrades have nothing to do with experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:45.75,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.25,0:08:51.21,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So maybe let's stop trying to \Nempathize with the characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:54.76,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,If we can't relate to them, \Nthen fine. That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:57.45,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So we just take shots in the dark, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:09:02.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Not exactly. Maybe think of it \Nas a math formula or a puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:04.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,A puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:07.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You get good grades in history, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:11.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. It's just memorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:15.20,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly. It might be easier \Nto understand modern literature
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:20.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,if you can remember the historical \Ncontext of when the book was written.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:26.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Since you're good at history,\Ntry linking that knowledge to the story,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:28.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,and maybe you'll understand it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:33.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're right. That might be easier for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:38.55,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's try practicing. There are only \Na few different types of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think you can prepare\N for them all by the retest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:49.07,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll pass the retest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I know you will, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:00.84,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:25.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. This last one is correct, \Ntoo. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:28.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:31.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Now if you just master the novels \Nthat will likely be covered,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:33.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,the retake should be a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:39.38,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you. You're a really good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.38,0:10:41.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.78,0:10:48.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.84,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Who knows? Can't say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:11:01.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fax-.2\fs20\shad0\b1\frx30\fry-20\frz338.2\c&HA1B0C6&\3c&H3D1BBD&\move(213.333,101.468,213.333,135.468)}Sanshiro\N{\fs14}Natsume Soseki
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.01,0:11:06.93,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1007,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\fs18\bord1\blur4\3c&H444242&\c&HCDDBE3&\pos(340,177.2)}Friday, July 17th
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:16.89,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Morning, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:18.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Morning, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm good today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:23.19,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll just grab toast or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:25.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:27.86,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You need to focus on studying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:30.34,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:39.09,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,As your instructor, \NI want you to pass the retest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:42.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So I'd prefer it if you concentrated \Non your studies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.09,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:49.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Then I'll do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:54.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're welcome. But it's not like \Nyou owe me anything for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.14,0:11:56.81,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.71,Default,girl,0,0,0,,I'll buy you a drink, so gimme 1,000 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.72,Default,girl,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:05.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,250)\an7\fnArial\fs8\shad0\c&H686868&\3c&HF5F5F0&}efficient study techniques\N\N\N{\b1}The 20 Most Efficient Study Methods: \NEven You-Know-Who Has Used These\NPowerful Secrets to Produce Results\N\NWhat do you need to study more efficiently?\NRecommended techniques explained simply\N\NIntroducing More Efficient Study Habits:\NWhat's the best way to study?\NHow to fix your bad study habits
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.57,0:12:07.62,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,1)\an7\fnArial\fs8\shad0\c&H686868&\3c&HF5F5F0&\b1}Up Your Efficiency with This Infallible Study Method:\NThe key to super efficient studying\Nis doing this one trick every day\N\NReevaluate your studying. Fix your bad habits \Nand win with more efficient study techniques!\N\NA surefire win! Master this powerful technique\N to increase your efficiency. Upgrade your study \Nbalance and prepare yourself for a liberal arts \Nuniversity education\N\NWhich Methods Are Wrong?\N Review your study methods to improve \Nyour efficiency
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:28.47,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:32.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Narasaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:36.38,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff! You carry the scent of the \NAsamura family yet again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:39.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Hey, Narasaka-san, you're kinda close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.41,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,We {\i1}are{\i0} close, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:44.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Would you quit calling me that at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:48.18,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,We're just bonding, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.98,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Right, Broski? Big Brudder? Brother Dearest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.41,0:12:54.19,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What's with all the variations?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:57.72,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I just wasn't sure which one would stick best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:00.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You sure are spirited today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:02.99,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yeah, because I'm all done with exams!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:07.17,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,And now I'm gonna release \Nall that pent-up stress at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:09.70,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So you don't have to take any retests?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.84,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Nope. I've never failed a test before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:16.26,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,My combined score on all \Nnine tests was 808 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:16.90,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,How's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:19.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Wow, eight hundred... Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:22.21,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,What? That surprised you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.26,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I bet you thought I couldn't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:27.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry, but no, I actually didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:32.29,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,That's so mean! I'm at the \Ntop of my class, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:37.99,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I've kept nearly a 90% average \Nall throughout high school!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:42.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay, since you're such \Nan excellent student,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.29,0:13:47.39,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yes? Don't be shy, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:50.86,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Aha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:57.44,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,So you're looking for a way to help \NSaki study more efficiently, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:14:00.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It feels like you're implying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.58,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,No, no. You just seem like a devoted brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:08.96,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I helped her study, but Ayase-san \Nis pretty smart to begin with,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:13.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,so I figure once she gets the hang of it, \Nshe won't need my help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:16.71,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yeah, that does sound like Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:23.08,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's why I was wondering if there's\Nany other way I can help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.58,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:35.62,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,But I really don't do anything \Nspecial in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:41.10,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I do listen to background music\N when working, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:45.36,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That actually might help. Do you \Nhave any recommended genres?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:46.89,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:47.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:53.68,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I just listen to whatever the app recommends.\N Searching for myself is a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.21,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:59.62,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,But you know, Asamura-kun, \Nyou really are a good brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.62,0:15:02.17,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,You should hold your head high!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:04.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't think this makes me a good brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.29,0:15:08.57,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Personally, I think cooking for my little \Nbrothers qualifies me as a great sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:09.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You have brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.79,0:15:12.46,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,I sure do! Tons of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:14.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Must be a really big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:16.38,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Yeah, about a hundred of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:19.80,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Just kidding! It's a much more \Nreasonable number.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:23.02,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So how many, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:29.16,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You seem down, my sweet junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.86,0:15:38.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, more customers on the weekend \Nmeans more annoying customers to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:43.16,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hold it right there. How could you talk\Nabout our dear customers that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:46.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Don't you usually complain about \Nthat a whole lot more than I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:48.60,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:50.72,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.21,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:54.89,Default,Yuta & Shiori,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:06.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You really don't show people \Nyour true colors, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:09.90,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I got tired of everyone \Ngetting sick of me at college.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:17.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\c&H719C96&\3c&H4B725A&\b1\pos(500.8,147.333)}Rewards Points Promotion\N{\c&H3A5C9D&\bord1\3c&H72ABA3&}Earn up to 30%
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:14.69,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You're the only one who knows every part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.69,0:16:16.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Quit making it sound weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:22.66,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\an1\bord0\c&H4A7872&\fay-.2\fax-.1\frz336.7\frx12\fry348\s1\pos(284.239,118.139)}Restock{\s0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:22.66,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\an1\bord0\c&H4A7872&\fay-.2\fax-.1\frx12\fry348\s1\pos(265.624,134.166)\frz338.4}Take care of holds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:22.66,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs8\shad0\an1\bord0\c&H4A7872&\fay-.2\fax-.1\frx12\fry348\s1\frz338.4\pos(246.024,150.566)}Clean up the back room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:21.40,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,All I did was state the naked truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:34.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm going to head ho—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.98,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You look melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.97,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Of course I'm melted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:46.08,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,The store is so crowded that \Nthe AC isn't having any effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:49.71,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,and I keep having to bend over\Nto carry all these heavy books.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:52.11,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's doing a number on my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:54.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, it isn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.06,0:16:58.77,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,At my age, the soreness won't hit for \Ntwo days, and by then I'll have a stiff neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:01.17,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,palpitations, and shortness of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:04.34,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Will you nurse me back to health, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.30,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:06.74,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sob, sob...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:11.22,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Now that you're with that floozy, \Nyou're just going to toss me aside?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:14.05,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Why can't you be nice to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.38,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to eat here \Nall by my lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:20.78,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Stay and tell me of your adventures \Nwith your darling little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:28.37,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I don't have any adventures to share, \Nbut can I ask you for some advice instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:31.42,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, now that does sound like \Nan interesting proposal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:40.08,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,So you want to help your sister \Nlearn to study more efficiently? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:46.58,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,And you've been looking into \Nbackground music, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:52.18,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I still can't really \Npin down the best genres for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:54.68,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:57.38,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I might have a recommendation for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let's see... Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:02.77,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:07.60,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I also wanted background music to work to,\Nso I spent some time looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:08.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:11.03,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Here, my sweet junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:11.86,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.82,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You want to hear it in high quality, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:25.16,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,All right, I'll play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.35,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:13.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\blur1\c&HC9EBEB&\an3\pos(647.273,195.09)\b1}S H I B U Y A   C E N T E R
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:01.25,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,This is really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:04.91,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I thought you could try using it as \Nbackground music when you study.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.65,0:20:08.71,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'm surprised you \Nlisten to music like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I actually just discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:14.85,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,My senpai at work introduced me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.18,0:20:17.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, the same one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:19.53,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,The beautiful older girl\Nwith encyclopedic knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:21.55,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:26.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say I get \Nmost of my recommendations from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You two must be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.11,0:20:34.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, we get a lot of shifts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:38.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:41.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:44.77,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I just got lost in the music for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:45.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:50.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So your senpai even has\Ngood taste in music, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:54.76,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, but personality-wise, \Nshe's kind of an airhead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:57.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,though in a really humorous way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:01.63,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Either way, she sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:04.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, that I can guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.16,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:16.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I really think that I keep taking \Ntoo much from you, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:23.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I know this wasn't much, \Nbut I hope it returns the favor a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:32.30,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll try listening to it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:34.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:40.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, just leave it there. \NI'll take care of the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:43.32,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Goodnight, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.41,0:22:05.43,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. Goodnight, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:49.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8FCEAB&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 5 {\fs14}"A Late Show and the{\c&H80B7E9&}Real {\c&H8FCEAB&}Deal"
